		"description": {
			"value": "<p><em>You speak a creature's name, their title, or otherwise specify a single creature, condemning them for past misdeeds.</em></p><p><strong>No Action Cost</strong> - Self - 1 Hour - Magical</p><p><em>Trigger: You use @UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.MUXZKqXOk5k1w8pS]{Commanding Challenge}, @UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.wjflquP9J7ItZqny]{Avenger's Leap}, or @UUID[Compendium.elkan5e.elkan5e-class-features.Item.2yjAwCh8FpQP0MAP]{Searing Retribution}.</em></p><ul><li><p>You have &amp;reference[advantage] on &amp;reference[attack rolls]{attack rolls} against the target.</p></li><li><p>You have advantage on all &amp;reference[investigation], &amp;reference[perception], and &amp;reference[survival] checks made to locate the creature.</p></li></ul>",
